{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我们还是分手吧？说真的没法过下去了」", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4097", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有没有办法过下去，不继续试试看怎么知道呢」", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这样的日子真的没办法继续了。\\n　在我们相互伤害得更深之前，还是分手比较好」", "text_idx": 196, "plain": "「这样的日子真的没办法继续了。　在我们相互伤害得更深之前，还是分手比较好」", "plain_idx": 197, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4098", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "才开始交往不久，我们就迎来了这破灭般的结局。", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然这样说，但并不是我俩的关系变差了。", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……新吾真的喜欢我吗？」", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4099", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「当然喜欢了」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「纱凪呢？」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我、我也……喜欢……」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4100", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4101", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪看了看我的脸，然后慢慢低下了头。", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "从今天早上开始就一直是这个样子。", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "微妙的距离感。", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这比告白之前更加拉开距离了。", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「昨天，在那之后呢」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4102", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯」", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我回到家就试着练习到很晚」", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4103", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「练习什么？」", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……作、作为新吾女朋友的撒娇方法？」", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4104", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我们，多少也算是开始交往了……\\n　所以我就想着，这些方面也应该开始注意下才行……」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": "「我们，多少也算是开始交往了……　所以我就想着，这些方面也应该开始注意下才行……」", "plain_idx": 222, "len": 43, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4105", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是啊，你不觉得从刚才开始就稍微有些距离感吗？」", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因、因为要是太靠近的话，我就没办法好好说话了……」", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4106", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「身为女朋友，我不知道要做些什么才好」", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4107", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪很认真地考虑着我们成为恋人这件事。", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也是一样。", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "既然已经开始交往，那两人之间的氛围也会开始变得不一样。", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "应该怎么与对方接触，才能像是恋人一样。", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……果然，我还是觉得分手比较好」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4108", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪背向我，\\n逐渐走到了我无法摸头的距离。", "text_idx": 235, "plain": "纱凪背向我，逐渐走到了我无法摸头的距离。", "plain_idx": 236, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在告白之前这是很自然就能做到的事，\\n但现在却因为害羞而完全没办法。", "text_idx": 237, "plain": "在告白之前这是很自然就能做到的事，但现在却因为害羞而完全没办法。", "plain_idx": 238, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "对于这样的变化，我们两人都感到手足无措。", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我突然想到，\\n　咱俩是不是从开始交往之前就一直做着很羞耻的事情啊？」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": "「我突然想到，　咱俩是不是从开始交往之前就一直做着很羞耻的事情啊？」", "plain_idx": 241, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4109", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「牵手啊摸头啊之类的，\\n　还有摸肚子和公主抱什么的……」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": "「牵手啊摸头啊之类的，　还有摸肚子和公主抱什么的……」", "plain_idx": 244, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4110", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪说着说着，脸就红到了耳根。", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我真是太不知廉耻了」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4111", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "现在又开始低沉了起来，我也不知道该做出什么样的反应才好。", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是，我不想因为这种理由而分手」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我、我也是啊！」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4112", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过，我现在都没办法正眼看新吾的脸。\\n　要我像女朋友一样撒娇是不可能的……」", "text_idx": 253, "plain": "「不过，我现在都没办法正眼看新吾的脸。　要我像女朋友一样撒娇是不可能的……」", "plain_idx": 254, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4113", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「早知道会变成这样的话，\\n　还不如回到交往之前的那个时候更好呢……」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": "「早知道会变成这样的话，　还不如回到交往之前的那个时候更好呢……」", "plain_idx": 257, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4114", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪因为我的事情而烦恼着。", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这让我高兴的同时，也感受到了痛苦。", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我啊，觉得自己的心意能够传达到真是太好了」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「？！」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4115", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我不想回到交往之前，\\n　因为没必要再欺骗自己了」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": "「我不想回到交往之前，　因为没必要再欺骗自己了」", "plain_idx": 265, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我开始慢慢接近她。\\n纱凪则是吓了一跳似的，抬头看向我。", "text_idx": 266, "plain": "我开始慢慢接近她。纱凪则是吓了一跳似的，抬头看向我。", "plain_idx": 267, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……像我这样的人也可以吗？」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4116", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「作为女朋友，我绝对是不可爱的。\\n　说话不好听，性格也很糟糕，身材什么的更是……」", "text_idx": 270, "plain": "「作为女朋友，我绝对是不可爱的。　说话不好听，性格也很糟糕，身材什么的更是……」", "plain_idx": 271, "len": 42, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4117", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「才不是什么可不可以」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「除了纱凪，我谁都不要」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「笨、笨蛋！不要一脸认真地说这么令人害羞的话，\\n　而且还是这么近的距离……」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": "「笨、笨蛋！不要一脸认真地说这么令人害羞的话，　而且还是这么近的距离……」", "plain_idx": 276, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4118", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我看着脸越来越红的纱凪，想要疼爱她的感情逐渐涌上心头。", "text_idx": 278, "plain": "我看着脸越来越红的纱凪，想要疼爱她的感情逐渐涌上心头。", "plain_idx": 278, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「话说在前头，其实我也……！」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4119", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……不，果然还是算了」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4120", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什么？好想听你说完啊」", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4121", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也，那个……只有新吾，所以……」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4122", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊不行了，脸好热！\\n　我到底在说什么啊，笨蛋笨蛋笨蛋……！」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": "「啊啊不行了，脸好热！　我到底在说什么啊，笨蛋笨蛋笨蛋……！」", "plain_idx": 288, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4123", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔唔唔，等到下周一还是这个状态的话会出大问题的。\\n　在教室里随时都会和新吾对上眼啊……」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": "「唔唔唔，等到下周一还是这个状态的话会出大问题的。　在教室里随时都会和新吾对上眼啊……」", "plain_idx": 291, "len": 46, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4124", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这件事情对大家保密比较好吗」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「肯，肯定不可能说出来的啦」", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4125", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「以前在教室里经常骂你，\\n　现在却要说喜欢上了什么的……」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": "「以前在教室里经常骂你，　现在却要说喜欢上了什么的……」", "plain_idx": 297, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4126", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而且之后绝对会被其他女孩子问“新吾这个人怎么样呀？”之类的事情……」", "text_idx": 299, "plain": "「而且之后绝对会被其他女孩子问“新吾这个人怎么样呀？”之类的事情……」", "plain_idx": 299, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4127", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……所以，现在咱们的关系就先保密？」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「保密归保密……但我们需要有人理解」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4128", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有人理解？」", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「对，我们需要找到一个我们信任的人」", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4129", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果要找一个知道我们俩的情况，\\n　而且愿意和我们商量对策的人……」", "text_idx": 307, "plain": "「如果要找一个知道我们俩的情况，　而且愿意和我们商量对策的人……」", "plain_idx": 308, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4130", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也一起思考着，\\n脑中逐渐出现了一个符合要求的人物。", "text_idx": 310, "plain": "我也一起思考着，脑中逐渐出现了一个符合要求的人物。", "plain_idx": 311, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪似乎也想到了，立刻开口说道。", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱理」", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4131", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「隼太」", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咦咦？椋梨知道我们的事情吗？」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4132", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什么，濑名同学也知道吗？」", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们点了点头，下定了决心。", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「既然这样的话——」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": "「既然这样的话——」", "plain_idx": 320, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4133", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你俩齐刷刷地一起冲过来，\\n　还以为要说什么呢……」", "text_idx": 322, "plain": "「你俩齐刷刷地一起冲过来，　还以为要说什么呢……」", "plain_idx": 323, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1733", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就算你说要让我们成为伙伴，这也……」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6564", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天是周六，学校也放假了。", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为学生会的工作而来学校的隼太被我们逮住了。", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总之，新吾你现在已经和小乾开始交往了对吧？」", "text_idx": 330, "plain": "「总之，新吾你现在已经和小乾开始交往了对吧？」", "plain_idx": 330, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1734", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没错」", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「纱凪也对此没有异议吧？」", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6565", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没有异议」", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4134", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "隼太＆爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 337, "voice": "_ar6566", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "他们两人看了看对方，一副无语的表情。", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪则是一脸通红地从我身边离开。", "text_idx": 340, "plain": "纱凪则是一脸通红地从我身边离开。", "plain_idx": 340, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……濑名同学，对于这俩人你怎么看」", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1736", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就算你问我也……\\n　他们真的在交往吗？居然如此不自然地拉开了距离……」", "text_idx": 343, "plain": "「就算你问我也……　他们真的在交往吗？居然如此不自然地拉开了距离……」", "plain_idx": 344, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6567", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾你就不能和小乾挨近一点吗？」", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1737", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我们也有各种各样的原因」", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……有各种各样的原因」", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4135", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪这种时候总是会变得非常老实。", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6568", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「虽然我明白你们想要对班上的同学保密，\\n　不过这很难做到吧」", "text_idx": 353, "plain": "「虽然我明白你们想要对班上的同学保密，　不过这很难做到吧」", "plain_idx": 354, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6569", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也对啊」", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1738", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「为什么？我们也没有卿卿我我之类的。\\n　而且刚才告诉你们我俩开始交往的时候，\\n　爱理刚才不也觉得很不可思议吗」", "text_idx": 358, "plain": "「为什么？我们也没有卿卿我我之类的。　而且刚才告诉你们我俩开始交往的时候，　爱理刚才不也觉得很不可思议吗」", "plain_idx": 359, "len": 57, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4136", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「话虽这样说，但一看你们的眼神就明白了」", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6570", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「眼神？」", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4137", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我和纱凪相互望了望，再次看向濑名同学。", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「纱凪的眼神里充斥着太多对瓜生的爱意了」", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6571", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾也一直是对小乾投以怜爱的目光」", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1739", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "对于这突如其来的评价，我和纱凪不禁又看向彼此。", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "仅仅是这样，纱凪的脸颊便已通红。", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这到底要怎么办才好啊……」", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1740", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过，要是大家知道纱凪和男生开始交往了，\\n　肯定会造成不小的骚动吧……」", "text_idx": 374, "plain": "「不过，要是大家知道纱凪和男生开始交往了，　肯定会造成不小的骚动吧……」", "plain_idx": 375, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6572", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「毕竟是那个小乾啊……」", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1741", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「纱凪在班里可是出了名的厌男啊」", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6573", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……因为人家是真的喜欢上了嘛」", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4138", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以说，不要用那种眼神去看瓜生啦」", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6574", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾也是，从刚才开始就眯着眼睛满怀爱意地盯着看过头了」", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1742", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就算这样说，满怀爱意也是没办法的事。", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我对新吾的爱意，有表现得那么明显吗？」", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4139", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「从旁人的视角来看，已经是腻到不行了」", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6575", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「隼太，那我呢？」", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，怎么说呢……\\n　总之你很溺爱小乾这件事已经很明白了」", "text_idx": 393, "plain": "「嗯，怎么说呢……　总之你很溺爱小乾这件事已经很明白了」", "plain_idx": 394, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1743", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "对于这无法否定的事实，我只能保持沉默。", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果真的要保密的话，\\n　下周之前一定要好好振作起来才行哦？」", "text_idx": 397, "plain": "「如果真的要保密的话，　下周之前一定要好好振作起来才行哦？」", "plain_idx": 398, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6576", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没错没错，说到底这还是你们俩的问题」", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1744", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……唔」", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4140", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "话音刚落，我们俩又看向了对方。", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「决定了，从现在开始我就称呼新吾为“瓜生”」", "text_idx": 405, "plain": "「决定了，从现在开始我就称呼新吾为“瓜生”」", "plain_idx": 405, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4141", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾也……不对，瓜生也用姓来称呼我吧？」", "text_idx": 407, "plain": "「新吾也……不对，瓜生也用姓来称呼我吧？」", "plain_idx": 407, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4142", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是只在教室里才那样做，对吧？」", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「当然。这样的话，\\n　就连爱理他们也会对我们疏远的关系而感到震惊吧」", "text_idx": 410, "plain": "「当然。这样的话，　就连爱理他们也会对我们疏远的关系而感到震惊吧」", "plain_idx": 411, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4143", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然感觉事情朝着奇怪的方向发展了，\\n但这样的纱凪是无法被阻止的。", "text_idx": 413, "plain": "虽然感觉事情朝着奇怪的方向发展了，但这样的纱凪是无法被阻止的。", "plain_idx": 414, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「虽然在交往第一天差点就要分手了，\\n　但我会加油的」", "text_idx": 415, "plain": "「虽然在交往第一天差点就要分手了，　但我会加油的」", "plain_idx": 416, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4144", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而且过了一天之后，也能稍微冷静下来一些」", "text_idx": 418, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4145", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯，确实是这样也说不定」", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们两人都是第一次谈恋爱，\\n说不定是情绪过于高昂了的原因。", "text_idx": 421, "plain": "我们两人都是第一次谈恋爱，说不定是情绪过于高昂了的原因。", "plain_idx": 422, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只要过一段时间，\\n就能恢复像以前那样自然的关系了。", "text_idx": 423, "plain": "只要过一段时间，就能恢复像以前那样自然的关系了。", "plain_idx": 424, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这就是我当时的想法。", "text_idx": 425, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
